msgid ""
"Kdenlive is a non linear video editor. It is based on the MLT framework and "
"accepts many audio and video formats, allows you to add effects, transitions "
"and render into the format of your choice."
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive ye un editor de videu non llinial. Básase nel framework MLT y "
"aceuta muchos formatos d'audiu y videu, permítete amestar efeutos, "
"transiciones y renderizar nel formatu de la to escoyeta."

